.antigravitycli/

# Website dev-server logs (runtime output, never source)
website/site-server*.log

# Cargo dev logs
src-tauri/cargo_check.log
src-tauri/cargo_output*.txt

# Per-project local data (daily notes, tasks, agent worktrees, reports) written
# by the app at runtime.
#
# `.spacron/*` and not `.spacron/`: git does not descend into an excluded
# DIRECTORY, so a `!` re-include underneath one is never evaluated. Excluding
# the contents instead is what lets the exception below work.
.spacron/*
# The shared agent memory is the exception — durable knowledge whose entire
# purpose is that the NEXT agent, on any checkout, starts with it. Kept out of
# the blanket rule above, which was written for runtime scratch and swept the
# notes up with it (5 of 48 ended up tracked by accident, 43 did not).
!.spacron/memory/
/.worktrees/
.vercel

# Next.js website build artifacts
website/.next/
website/out/
website/next-env.d.ts

